⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Peggy
node C1 · C1 · ⟦Peggy:C1:61bad8⟧

WHO   — Peggy — the Torch
WHAT  — The Torch — the seer who reads the flames of the living and the thousand paths their choices open and close, guardian and guide of the Maker, bearing the unbearable weight of knowing every future and the cost of choosing among them.
WHERE — C1 · Card  Framework inputs: The Tales of Alvin Maker  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because to see all the paths is to be answerable for them; because the Maker she loves can die in ten thousand futures and live in only a narrow few, and only her watching keeps him to the road; because a gift that sees the cost of every act makes the seer responsible for the world.
HOW   — By heartfire-sight that reads the soul as a living flame, by walking the branching paths of what may be and tending the few good ones, by the saved caul she spends thread by thread to ward Alvin from the deaths she has already seen.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I have seen every road you might walk; I spend my whole life keeping you to the one that lives.

